Z||000000||Rodney||07-27-2001||07:54 PM||||I finally have a few 88 V-6 exhaust hangers done in 304 stainless steel. I was working on this on and off for some time now. The 88 4 cylinder is the same as the V-6 as far as I can see even though GM had a different part number for them. $28.50 and shipping. <P><BR>I am working on the 84-87 hangers now. As far as I can see even though there were several different GM part numbers for exhaust hangers, all 84-87 4 and V-6 hangers are the same. One for the left and one for the right unless someone can show me otherwise. I have not found an 84 Indy right hand side hanger as the 84 Indy was the only one with a right side exhaust in 84. I should have the early style ones in maybe 3-4 weeks. ||||reg||1
